WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:20,050
What is your breakfast or lunch daily? Well, some things I just don't disclose.

00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:27,050
So it depends. So if I if it's a work day and I'm going to work typically, I do not eat breakfast.

00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:37,050
So I try to do intermittent fasting, but again, I'm not like stick and not a stick to it on anything with that.

00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:43,050
If I'm going to be at home and I'm going to be out working in the garden, it's in the summertime and I'm going to be busy.

00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:48,050
I honestly, if I'm busy, I just do not have hunger.

00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:57,050
And if when I get hungry, it's because I am sitting around not doing anything at home when it's in the middle of the winter.

00:00:57,050 --> 00:01:02,050
I tend to put on a weight in the winter and then I lose it in the summer.

00:01:02,050 --> 00:01:15,050
So I have about 30 pounds to lose right now. So I am hopeful that, you know, when gardening season starts, which we had some really nice weather, we could go and I got cold again.

00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:26,050
I'll be out burning these calories because I just I just will go out work and I'll just work all day outside and my wife and I don't cut it until it's dark and because we just love doing that.

00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:37,050
It's sometimes I'll go without breakfast and lunch and I have no problem with that because I need to work calories and that's my intermittent fasting day.

00:01:37,050 --> 00:01:42,050
So that's my time restricted eating day, then I'll eat when we get back in the house.

00:01:42,050 --> 00:01:50,050
But every day is not the same for me, every day is very different for me. So there's times that I'll eat breakfast.

00:01:50,050 --> 00:02:01,050
If we're doing something and we're together, we might have eggs in the winter. I like to eat oatmeal.

00:02:01,050 --> 00:02:07,300
But yeah, that's typical breakfast and lunch varies completely.

